IN TUCKER", "message": "And so modest, too.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Is he the new guy? Oh, he's dreamy.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Tucker! How nice of you to arrive in time for a crushing defeat. I was afraid you would simply spend all your time running from my awesome might.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Uncle says Tucker is dangerous.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Hush, Major. Watch and learn.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "scroll", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Cowards!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "What just happened? Are they even allowed to do that? Weren't you supposed to be teaching me how to do something?", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "They detonated the unit, rather than see it fall into our hands. Where are you Tucker, you coward?! Where did he go? Off hiding in some cave?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I demand a do-over! DO-OVER!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Major, I have a very important task for you.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Ooh! What is it?", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "The engineers have quite a lot of work ahead of them sifting through the rubble for the parts they need. They can't be left unprotected.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "But what are you going to do?", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I mean to find Captain Tucker, and grind him into dust.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}